{"case_id": "taiwan_female_19880215_P007-Q31", "domain": "family", "question": "命主原生家庭父母亲状况？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，年柱为戊辰，月柱为甲寅，日柱为庚子，时柱为甲申。日主庚金生于寅月，木旺金囚，月干甲木偏财透出，年干戊土偏印生身，但地支寅木与辰土有半会木局之势，财星极旺。庚金坐子水伤官，时支申金为禄根，但申子辰三合水局，伤官泄身严重，日主身弱。\n\n原生家庭看年柱与月柱。年柱戊辰，戊土偏印为母星，辰土为父星（偏财之库），但月柱甲寅为偏财，甲木克戊土，且寅木冲申金（时支），家庭宫位动荡。年干戊土被月干甲木克制，代表母亲受父亲影响或压制；年支辰土与月支寅木半合木局，财星过旺，父缘强而母缘弱。日主庚金弱，伤官旺，伤官克官，家庭中易有冲突。\n\n综合判断，月柱偏财透干且旺，年柱偏印受克，父母关系不睦，且伤官旺主离异之象。时支申金为日主之根，但被寅木冲，申为父位（偏财之根），冲则父离；日支子水为母位（伤官），但子水泄身，母缘亦淡。结合台湾地区常见情况，命主更可能随父亲生活，因偏财旺而印星弱。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "taiwan_female_19880215_P007-Q31", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_0_g3\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4697, "response_id": "0070db3e-44f1-4a88-9df0-ae4ed809dbb5", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 223, "completion_tokens": 360, "total_tokens": 583, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 95}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "taiwan_female_19880215_P007-Q32", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主大学时期读什么科系？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主为庚金，生于寅月（木旺），年柱戊辰（土生金），月柱甲寅（木旺克土），日柱庚子（金水相生），时柱甲申（木金交战）。整体来看，命局中木气旺盛（甲木双透，寅木当令），金有土生但受木克，水为食伤（子水），火不显。\n\n大学时期（约18-22岁，即2006-2010年）行运，需看大运。命主生于1988年，女性，阳年（戊辰年）出生，大运逆排。月柱甲寅，逆排为癸丑、壬子、辛亥、庚戌等。大学阶段大约在壬子、辛亥运（水运）。水为食伤，主才华、艺术、表达，但命局木旺，水能生木，木为财星，也主实际利益。\n\n食伤旺且透水，倾向于艺术、创意、表达类，但木旺为财，也可能偏向商业或应用艺术。选项中，音乐（A）和美术（C）都属艺术，但音乐更偏“声”与“表达”，美术更偏“形”与“视觉”。命局中金被木克，金主声（音乐），但木旺克金，音乐可能受阻；而水为食伤，主流动、色彩，美术更符合水木相生的意象。金融（B）属金，但金弱受克，不显；理工（D）属金水，但木旺克土，土生金不力，也不突出。\n\n综合食伤生财，且木为财，美术（C）更贴近“食伤生财”且偏艺术视觉的象意。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "taiwan_female_19880215_P007-Q32", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_0_g3\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5601, "response_id": "c5f98258-ec8a-46c6-a6e6-11b1e1e59053", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 207, "completion_tokens": 393, "total_tokens": 600, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 79}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
